~ start
#do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(700.0, 700.0), 0.4, 1, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(3072.0, 0.0), 1, 1, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Fenn: Hello? Winston?
Az: I know the light's here, gimme a sec.
#do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(700.0.0, 700.0), 0.6, 3, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Lights flash on.
Az: Hmph. Everything looks okay.
Az: And the pict- oh. Huh.
Winston: WELCOME, FOOLS
#do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(3072.0.0, 0.0), 1, 3, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Az: Whoa. Nevermind.
Az: Wait- that's what you look like?
Winston: WHAT? Do I hath something on my faceth?
Az: Nah. You're just, like, a skinny nerd.
Winston: Ahem. IGNORING THAT!
Winston: BEHOLDETH!
Fenn: BY THE SENDER! IT'S- I- What- what is it?
WInston: MY LATEST CREATION. THE ICI-CLONE!!
Winston: Thou see, my power is limited. I may maketh things. Devices, weapons, creatures... but I cannot controleth them.
Winston: SO! I thought to myself... what can I controleth?
Fenn: Your attitude?
Az: Your incompetence?
Winston: I CAN CONTROLETH MYSELF!
Fenn: Uh oh...
Az: Huh.
Winston: If I maketh a copyeth of myself...
Winston: Wouldst it not want the same things I wanteth? Wouldst it not do the same things I wouldst?
Fenn: Bring it on! I shalt free the Knights from thy grasp!!!
Az: Wait wait, hold on, Fenn. I kinda wanna see what happens.
Winston: THUS! WITNESS THE CREATION OF THE ONE. THE ONLY.
Winston: ICETON!!
Machine whirs, and opens
Smoke bellows and then clears to reveal an ice version of winston
Winston: Holy sh- it worked? IT WORKED!!
Fenn: Are we in danger?
Az: Hmph. Maybe.
Winston: ICETON, GO! ATTACKETH THEM! DESTROYETH THEM!
Iceton takes a few steps towards Az and Fenn. Az and Fenn retreat in sync.
Fenn: Uh oh.
Iceton turns around, rushes towards Winston, and starts beating him up.
Az: Huh?
Fenn: Winston?
Winston: NO! No no... STOP THIS!
Winston: Y- you're my creation! You're ME! Listen to me!!
Winston: Please, stop! Wh- why are you attacking me? Please!
Az: Dang. I really thought we were in danger there for a sec.
Fenn: Az, we have to help him.
Az: Ugh...
Fenn: He's in danger! He needs h-
Az: I know! I'll grab him.
Fenn: What can I do?
Az: You know that other heater I mentioned? Behind my workshop?
Fenn: Yeah? Oh. Oh!
Az: I'll protect Winston in the meantime. It might just be enough to melt Iceton.
Az: The door at the back should lead you to it, but be careful.
Fenn: On it!
do EventFlags.set_flag("13-AzWs-FinalConfrontation-Workshop", true)
=> END